hermes-net (0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Split the old sBitx controller (sbitx_controller, sbitx_client,
    sbitx.service, /etc/sbitx) out of rhizo-uuardop into its own package,
    sbitx-controller, so that a station running hermes-radio-daemon can
    install rhizo-uuardop without it.  A station upgrading from 0.1 that
    still runs sbitx_controller must install sbitx-controller as well.
  * One uucpd.service for every station, which requires no radio
    controller; its options are in /etc/default/uucpd.  sbitx.service
    conflicts with radiod.service.  Units are in /usr/lib/systemd/system and
    none is enabled or started by the packages.
  * uucpd -F, the pre-agreed UUCP startup (needs uucp 1.07-37 or later).

 -- Rafael Diniz <rafael@rhizomatica.org>  Fri, 25 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

